"summary": "The file formalises R_k(3) as the least n such that every k-colouring of the edges of K_n has a monochromatic triangle. It states four results: R_k(3)^{1/k} → ∞; an explicit lower bound (c·k^{1/3}/log k)^k with c = 1/(6e^38), conjoined with the same limit; log R_k ≥ (1/4−ε)k log k and ≤ (1+ε)k log k eventually; and log R_k = Θ(k log k). The main caveat is that the lower-coefficient theorem uses 1/4, although the paper's bound gives 1/3−o(1), so the name 'sharp_coefficients' is misleading.",
